    <HediffDef>
        <defName>MX_Mingyuan_SelfBurn</defName>
        <label>&lt;color=#FFB25C&gt;Self Burn&lt;/color&gt;</label>
        <description>Self Burn bonuses apply once per complete 10 layers, up to 300 layers. Each 10 layers grants +4% melee and skill damage, +0.8% ranged damage, +2% movement, and +4% attack and work speed. Above 300 layers, Overburn doubles direct damage and Life Burn output and drains the flame reserve. Every 10 seconds, all excess layers are consumed in a radius-5 explosion centered on Mingyuan, dealing 1 damage per layer. Nearby allies and buildings can be hit; Mingyuan is excluded.</description>
